# Shipping label template of a seed merchant: the document documents/examples/shipping-labels with Slots for each
# dispatch. The sheet of eight labels for A4 label paper (two columns of four labels of 99.1 × 67.7 mm: a Grid with
# fixed column and row sizes, and the margins of the sheet in Page), the merchant as sender and the layout of a label
# are part of the template; the date of the dispatch, the first and last order, and the labels come in the data, one
# object per label: its number on the sheet, the service with the style of its band, the parcel and the number of
# parcels of the order, the recipient with the lines of the address, the order, the weight without its unit, the routing
# code and the SSCC. Each label has the service written vertically in a coloured band (a Text with Rotate: -90, which
# takes the rectangle of the rotated text, centred in a vertical Stack), a GS1-128 barcode with the SSCC and its
# readable text, and a Data Matrix with the routing code, the order and the weight for the sorting machines. The name of
# the recipient has a fixed height and Overflow: shrink, so a long name gets smaller, on two lines, instead of pushing
# the barcode out of the label. The dotted outline of each label is for checking the sheet on screen; it falls on the
# cuts of the paper. shipping-labels.json has the sample data.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 13.1mm 4.65mm
	Title: Shipping labels · Willow & Moss · Dispatch of ${date}
	Subject: Eight parcel labels with SSCC barcodes for orders ${first_order} to ${last_order}
	Author: Willow & Moss Seeds
	Language: en
	Section:
		Grid:
			Id: sheet
			Style: sheet
			Area: [labels]
				Stack:
					Id: label-${number}
					Style: label
					Item:
						Stack:
							Style: band ${band}
							Item:
								Block:
									Text: <service>
										Style: service
										Rotate: -90
					Item:
						Grow: 1
						Base size: 0
						Block:
							Style: label-body
							Stack:
								Style: label-head
								Item:
									Grow: 1
									Base size: 0
									Text: From Willow & Moss Seeds, York YO1 6JB
										Style: sender
								Item:
									Text: ${parcel} of ${parcels}
										Style: parcel
							Stack:
								Style: address-row
								Item:
									Grow: 1
									Base size: 0
									Block:
										Text: Deliver to
											Style: deliver-to
										Text: <recipient>
											Style: to-name
										Text: [address]<text>
											Style: to-line
								Item:
									Barcode: ${route} ${order} ${weight}kg
										Style: matrix
										Barcode format: data-matrix
										Alt: Data Matrix with the routing code ${route} and order ${order}
							Barcode: (00)${sscc}
								Style: sscc
								Barcode format: gs1-128
								Readable text: true
								Alt: GS1-128 barcode with the SSCC ${sscc} of parcel ${parcel} of ${parcels} of order ${order}
							Stack:
								Style: label-foot
								Item:
									Text: Order ${order}
								Item:
									Text: ${weight} kg
								Item:
									Text: Route ${route}
										Style: route
